                                   ConstructorPattern, RecordPattern, PatternField, ListPattern,
                                   OrPattern, Callees, InFull, Among, Constant, Unwritten, Variable,
                                   Binary, Unary, Lambda, Call, OnValue, OnValueCall, If, Match,
                                   Record, RecordUpdate, Field, ListOf, Perform, Handle, WithScope,
                                   Simulate, Parallel, Tagged, Filled, FilledHole, TryBlock,
                                   RaisedOperation, Block, Arm, StoredHandle, HandlerClause, Entry,
                                   One, Commuting, Let, LetElse, Effectful, Assign, Generics,
                                   ParameterConstraint, Returning, Unstated, Fresh,
                                   ParameterReturned, FunctionForm, Variant, TypeBody, Alias, Sum,
                                   Nominal, Extern, InstanceFunction, Numeric, TypeForm, Operation,
